WEBVTT

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.720
That's ridiculous. Is this the truth?

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:11.920
Of course, there has been no official proclamation of joining hands with Gastark.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.050
However, the one who joined forces with Duke Stearied

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:19.050
and plotted your assassination was unmistakably Runa.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.870
And?

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:26.970
Did the king of Runa say he'd like to get along with us, even if only in appearance?

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:31.190
No, sir. I was unable to meet with the king.

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:34.920
He has apparently shut himself inside a small castle within Runa's borders.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.400
It seems as though he was coerced by messengers from Gastark.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:42.600
A threat so grave it makes a king yield? How many people were killed?

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.490
Every soldier protecting the castle, they say.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.620
Further problems are just emerging as well.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.300
According to my information,

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.670
there are rumors that Gastark used some form of strange magic in its battle with Stohl.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.550
Strange magic?

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.330
Incredibly, one shot of this magic

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:04.140
completely negated some very large-scale magic from Stohl,

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.890
and obliterated troops numbering in the tens of thousands.

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:10.600
Something so sudden, I find hard to believe.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.810
But if it is true, then it would lend significant credence to the rumors

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:19.310
that the Runa Empire was forced to capitulate before Gastark's messengers.

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:25.260
Does this mean Gastark has also begun to use them?

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.450
Hero relics...

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:31.350
If our situation degenerates to the point

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:34.710
of every nation competing to gather them and clashing against one another...

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:37.880
At that point, the world would be...

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:11.770
Say.

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:13.190
What is it?

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:16.750
I wonder how Sion's doing these days.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.250
He's probably the same as usual,

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:22.550
acting diabolically and using foul methods to get what he wants.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:25.260
Probably. It's all his fault...

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.320
Want to kill him?

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:27.280
Yeah!

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.740
Just you wait, Sion! When we get back to Roland,

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:32.940
I'll torment you and torment you and torment you until you die!

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:39.730
So how did we end up like this, again?

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:45.870
That's because you did your usual thing, getting violent with the female passengers,

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.490
and angering all of the ship's sailors...

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.750
I didn't anger anybody!

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.490
Besides, to me,

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.770
it looked more like you and Milk's group made a mess out of everything,

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:55.250
and tore the ship apart.

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:08.600
I was expecting to get a little quiet after sending Arua and Kuku back to Roland,

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.890
but they came back with a swift attack.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:14.390
Well, they're probably safe, anyway.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.470
Whoa now, are you serious?

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:18.980
It would appear to be a storm.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.030
This is no time to talk like that!

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.710
<i>Ah, I'm gonna die.</i>

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:52.510
I'm... alive?

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:58.310
Amazing. I was convinced I was dead just now.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:01.820
Ferris! Hey!

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:08.700
Smells like something's cooking.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.980
Oh, Captain Milk...

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:18.250
While I, Luke Stokkart, was with you,

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:21.520
the whole squadron got completely scattered.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:24.380
Tomorrow, as soon as the sun rises, I'll go out looking for you,

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:27.380
so please stay safe until then!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:28.510
Oh, no!

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:33.510
I made enough portions for the whole squadron without realizing it.

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:37.520
Captain Milk, what a shame, when I know how much you love camping like this.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.560
Wherever you are right now...

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:55.220
Come on, what's this? Already in combat mode?

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:06.160
Delicious. It keeps the tastes without having any of the bad smell.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.510
Meticulous types like this are...

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.360
Ryner Lute?!

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:25.190
You're... with the taboo-breaker squadron?

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:34.830
I wonder if Luke and the others are safe? And Ryner...

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.080
Ryner...

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:40.500
Listen. Hold on tight to my hand, and whatever you do, don't let go.

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:44.890
I'll be sure to save you, okay, Ryner?

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.270
<i>She's alone?</i>

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:57.220
<i>That means that now's my chance! Wait for me, Ryner!</i>

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:06.000
Oww...

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.140
What's this?

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:11.200
I thought I heard someone, and it's the woman that Ryner tricked and abandoned.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:18.990
I-I haven't been abandoned! You're the one who should free Ryner immediately!

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:23.250
I know you're using Ryner against his will!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:28.090
You misunderstand. It is I who is being threatened by that man and forced to...

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:30.380
Ryner would never do that!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:34.450
I, too, think this may be a misunderstanding of some sort.

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:39.510
That man is always after me, and even sinks his poisonous fangs into my little sister,

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:41.180
night after night...

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.560
I cannot bear to speak any further!

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:50.400
You're wrong, you're wrong, you're wrong! Ryner's not like that!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.600
The other day, we entrusted children to your care.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:57.260
Those were actually his secret children.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.130
You lie!

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:04.230
As proof, did they not show respect and emotional attachment to Ryner?

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.790
That's not all.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.940
In Nelpha, he sunk his poisonous fangs into many married women in the capital,

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:12.640
and in Runa, he kidnapped village girls just walking down the road, one after another,

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.220
and furthermore, even their mothers were...

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:17.680
Yeesh.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:21.310
Why do I have to share a portion with you?

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:24.520
You must have it pretty tough. Even in the military,

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.680
the taboo-breaker squadron is known as the crummiest assignment you can get.

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:32.220
But because the king is all, "Work for the sake of Roland's future!"

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.530
you can't even skip out on it.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:39.150
Not so. His majesty is always working himself to the bone to improve our nation.

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:43.080
Is it our pleasure to work under such a splendid king.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:47.380
Again with that. You must have a lot deep down that you want to say.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:51.500
Like, "Don't work me so hard without a thought!" Or, "Give me a raise!"

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:55.170
Or, "Expand afternoon naptime to over 24 hours a day."

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:57.970
That would just mean you'd sleep all day!

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:01.780
I most certainly cannot have the captain become bride to a man like this.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:03.750
Hm? did you say something?

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.020
Ryner!

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:10.020
Captain Milk?!
Milk?!

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.520
Explain yourself, Ryner!

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:17.970
All your secret children, your secret wives, your lovers in Nelpha and Runa,

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.620
and, and... Well, you have tons!

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.170
What I seek is thunder! Izuchi!

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:23.830
Whoa! Cut it out!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.080
Please, Captain Milk, calm yourself! Captain!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.210
Hold it right there!

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:33.250
What's all this, out of the blue?!

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:35.270
Ferris!

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:40.340
Indeed, the dumplings made at the Wynnit dumpling shop are on a different level from others.

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:42.990
The Wynnit dumpling shop?

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.100
Where'd you even get...

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:49.740
I bought them, obviously. After all, this is within Roland's borders.

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:53.770
It is a territory of my family, House Eris, positioned along the Roland coastal region.

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:55.780
You can tell?

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:59.280
You can see a manor of House Eris from here. Didn't you notice?

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.490
There's no way I could see it from below!

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:05.180
Wait, hold on. You mean this is all Roland?

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:11.250
All right! Then let's go destroy the root of the evil that put us through all that crap!

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:15.380
Yes! On the dawn of his defeat, I shall become ruler in his stead,

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.920
and I shall make Roland into the Dumpling Empire!

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:23.220
Come on, at least make it the Dumpling and Afternoon Nap Empire!

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:26.640
Very well, I shall include both dumplings and afternoon naps at a 9:1 ratio respectively.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.100
All right!

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:32.750
Wait, a 9:1 ratio?! Oh well, let's go!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:37.280
H-Hold on a minute, Ryner!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:43.420
We'll make the arrogant bully king Sion pay for his tyrrany!

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:44.320
Yeah!

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:53.660
Long ago,

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.190
it is said that there existed countless beings

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.000
with power great enough to envelop the entire world.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.840
They were called demon lord, devils, dark gods.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:05.080
The world was constantly in danger of being destroyed at their hands.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:09.060
But, there were warriors, now called legendary heroes.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.960
They would appear with power greater than the demon lords,

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.570
and they would slay the monsters.

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:17.140
If someone were to find relics of these so-called "Heroes"

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:20.730
who defeated monsters strong enough to destroy the world...

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:24.990
"To achieve a world where nobody ever loses anything."

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:29.790
"A world where everyone can laugh and just take afternoon naps all the time."

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:34.250
Is it an empty dream?

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:45.880
Ridiculous. If it was, then why did I become king?

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:50.930
To change this out-of-balance world, to change everything...

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:54.480
To make a world where everyone can live happily with a smile...

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.730
Isn't that why I became king?

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:02.530
And now it's beyond my grasp?!

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:06.880
You think I'll just accept that?!

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:12.660
I-I'm sorry. I, uhm...

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:16.660
You're cleaning? Sorry to scare you like that.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:21.280
T-Thank you very much.

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:25.410
I-In my hometown, our lord treated us poorly and taxed us heavily.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.800
We were always suffering.

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:31.680
But thanks to you, Your Majesty, everyone's able to live well now.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:35.320
It is my pleasure to be able to work for you, Your Majesty.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:39.810
Thank you.

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:47.360
And plus, he's always so chipper on the outside.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:54.790
That's why everyone gets fooled and treats him like some kind of Hero King.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:58.210
Even though he's really an arrogant bully of a king!

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.700
Today, we kill him!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:03.840
I'll torment that smiling face of his until we kill him!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:06.010
He'll be rust on my blade!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.480
Come on, Ryner... W-W-What do we do?!

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:12.620
We can't let him assassinate the king!

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:15.180
I had him pinned as more than just an ordinary taboo-breaker,

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:17.770
but to think he was a fiend aiming to overthrow the royal family!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:22.940
Even for an attempted royal assassination, there would be no escaping the death penalty.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:27.160
W-W-We have to stop them, before Ryner commits even more crimes!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.990
Fear not, Captain!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:32.620
There's no way I'd let anyone try to assassinate His Majesty Astal!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.140
Lach!

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.960
Pull yourself together!

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.900
What's wrong, Ferris?

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:45.880
I thought I sensed some deadly intent, but I must have been imagining things.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:50.240
So, how will we torment Sion and kill him?

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.050
Good question.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.760
How about stealing something he likes and having him go,

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:58.020
"M-My precious thing... No, I can't take it anymore, flop!"

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:58.810
Like that?

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:03.410
I like it. So what's something precious to Sion?

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.810
M-Maybe dumplings?

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:07.280
That's what you like.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.030
What are you guys doing?

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:14.530
Claugh Klom?

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:17.900
I wasn't expecting to see you here, Luke.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:20.660
Weren't you assigned to the taboo-breaker squadron?

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.920
What are you doing here?

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:25.390
You two know each other?

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:27.270
A little, from back in the military.

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:30.670
Weren't you supposed to be sent to Estabul?

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:36.570
I was. But there were rumors that someone's trying to assassinate Sion again.

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:38.180
I came back to check it out.

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:40.800
Does that mean...?

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.480
Have they already been...?

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.810
They?

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.480
What's wrong?

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:51.610
M-My stomach hurts! My stomach... I have to go to the bathroom!

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:52.710
We can't have that, now!

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:53.690
Ow, ow!
We can't have that, now!

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:53.890
Captain Milk, the bathroom is this way!
Ow, ow!

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.660
It hurts!
Captain Milk, the bathroom is this way!

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.530
You'd better hurry!

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:04.000
Gotta hurry!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.800
Hey, don't just go off when...

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.470
Come on, let her be.

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:10.070
Putting that aside, I take it Sion's doing no differently?

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.170
He's as much of a workaholic as ever.

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:17.850
If he doesn't take a break once in a while, the guys working for him should beat him up.

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:23.850
Ryner, I'll be certain to protect you!

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:27.230
Ryner?!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.670
Ryner!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:30.640
Milk, get down!

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:32.820
What I seek is thunder. Izuchi!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.540
W-What?

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:40.290
Pull back!

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.160
Ferris!

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:50.170
You okay?

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.130
R-Ryner? Is this...

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:55.850
I'm not sure either. I thought I felt deadly intent.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:16:00.590
Are they assassins after Sion or something? The king's got it rough.

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:03.190
Seperate assassins?

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:07.270
Then, you weren't really planning to assassinate His Majesty after all, right?

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.310
Oh, yeah!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:14.570
Crap. If I'd left them alone, they could have taken care of Sion for me.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:18.550
Ferris, hold up! You can let those guys do what they want!

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:21.580
Ryner, you're such a...

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:24.540
What I seek is thunder! Izuchi!

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:25.620
Izuchi, Izuchi, Izuchi,

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:26.840
Cut it out!
Izuchi, Izuchi, Izuchi,

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.500
and an Izuchi!
Cut it out!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.140
Cut it out!

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:37.970
To oppose Gastark, a modicum of power will be needed.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:42.340
Which means I'll have to prioritize strengthening my hold on Estabul.

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:46.790
Even if I entrust the military to Claugh, I'll have to handle the nobles myself...

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:08.970
Are you trying to kill me?!

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:10.190
Good morning, Ryner.

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:14.550
Good morning, my ass! You could have broken my nose!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:18.720
You tried to kill me too, right? By leaving something like this over the door.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.180
So, when did you come back?

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.120
Just this morning.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.610
And? What are you doing in my bed?

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.370
It's a long story.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:31.590
Oh, yeah. I discovered an incredible truth!

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:32.480
Truth?

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:35.660
I recently got stuck drifting in the ocean.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:36.300
The ocean?

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:42.070
I couldn't see the coast at all. It was vast around me, and the sky was so high.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:46.070
I couldn't hear anything but the sound of waves and the cries of seafowl.

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:48.770
I found myself reflecting on a lot.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:51.710
Things like, can I be satisfied with my life the way it is?

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:55.480
Or why does it suck so much for me day after day?

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:58.390
Yes, I know just what you mean.

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.720
Then I realized it.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.870
It's him. It's his fault!

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:08.130
It's all the fault of that diaboilical king of the Roland Empire, Sion Astal!

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:10.810
So you tried to kill me?

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:11.920
With a dictionary?

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:12.810
With a dictionary.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:15.180
That's the truth you reached

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:17.400
after your travels all over the place these past few months?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.850
It's friggin' amazing, isn't it?

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:27.540
Yes, it's amazing. Truly amazing.

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:31.290
But Ryner, you acted rashly.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.100
A royal assassination is a serious crime.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:37.800
And when it's a Hero King, beloved by people across the nation?

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.600
You're calling yourself a Hero King now?

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:46.830
I've been wondering for a while. Where do you get that sort of confidence?

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:50.230
I'm a man who was meant to be king from the day he was born, after all.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.510
That doesn't embarrass you at all?

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:55.470
It's the truth, so I can't complain. See, my shine is different.

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:59.990
It's the shine of a man of a noble character that comes from a pure heart.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:06.200
I can't take this! I'll just kill you! And then I'll bring peace to this nation!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.490
Hold on, listen to me, Ryner!

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:16.030
Sion?

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.060
You must be tired.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:24.840
You think so?

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:27.850
Yeah, I do.

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:34.450
I'll be fine now.

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:36.160
I just had a chance to lie down.

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:40.690
Just for a second! If it was me, I'd sleep fifty hours a day.

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:44.790
Fifty hours a day? That's an amazing technique.

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:46.320
You think I could do it?

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:48.480
Why don't you try quitting all your work just once?

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:50.030
I could hardly...

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:51.120
Not gonna happen, then.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:56.520
You diabolical enemy of all dumplings, prepare yourself!

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:59.540
Ryner! Snap out of it!

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.170
T-The king has been bitten by the poisonous fangs of the perverted sex fiend?!

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:05.220
No way!

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:10.290
Huh? Your Majesty Astal? What is Ryner doing with you?

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:15.970
So that's how it is. I'm sorry, Ryner, for not noticing until now.

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:19.480
Even if the winds of society blow coldly upon you, be happy.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.880
What conclusions are you jumping to?!

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:30.910
To achieve a world where nobody ever loses anything.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.330
One that doesn't make that child or Kiefer cry.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.120
One where Tahile, Tony, and Fahle don't die.

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:40.150
One where Sion doesn't have to brood.

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:44.840
A world where everyone can laugh and just take afternoon naps all the time.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.570
Yes... the lynchpin.

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:50.970
So Milk Callaud is Ryner Lute's lynchpin.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.370
The tie that keeps Ryner Lute from leaving Roland,

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:58.100
or rather, from leaving Sion Astal.

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:03.240
That is the king's weakness.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:07.610
His fear of Ryner Lute leaving of his own accord.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.940
Hero relics.

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:14.740
Through them, a peaceful world created without killing anyone.

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:20.750
One that Ryner Lute desires, where no one dies, no one kills, and no one suffers.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:26.710
An ideal king... That is the chain that binds Sion Astal.

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:30.390
But that will break His Majesty.

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:33.220
An ideal king that fulfills everyone's hopes.

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:38.350
Illusions like that break people. They break kings.

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:46.070
Ryner Lute. It seems that your removal will be necessary.

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:24.030
<i>It's no use. As long as I stay in Roland,</i>

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:27.650
<i>I'll be used and killed by that diabolical, arrogant man!</i>

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:29.500
<i>I get the feeling that if I don't leave this country soon,</i>

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:32.580
<i>it's going to suck worse and worse!</i>

00:23:32.650 --> 00:23:35.350
<i>Okay, Ferris! Let's get in gear and set out!</i>
